  "cited_article_id": "search-update-pharmacy-directory",
  "reply": "Go to **Patients > Chart > Demographics**, open the **Pharmacy** tab, and click **Add Custom Pharmacy**. Fill in the required fields (Name, Address, Phone, Fax) with the new information and click **Save Entry**. Only staff with Medical Assistant or Provider roles can make this change. If the entry doesn’t appear when prescribing, refresh the browser cache (Ctrl+F5 or Cmd+Shift+R) and verify all mandatory address fields were completed."
}
